<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka Cold 3-month net up 197 pct.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka Cold 3-month net up 197 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for three months ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>				 1997	   1996</p>
<p>    Net profit	    61.48   vs    20,73</p>
<p>    Turnover	     442.46   vs   323.23</p>
<p>    Tax			8.50   vs    10.20</p>
<p>NOTE - Results are unaudited. Ceylon Cold Stores Ltd produces and markets carbonated soft drinks, ice creams and processed meats. It is a subsidiary of the blue chip John Keells Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>--- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
